# The upper-band strike arm ([[impossible-economy-problem]] class 3):
# strike 4000 sits below imptr12's median per-match max drop (5,550), so
# it opens in most matches but only on the deeper wave-breaks -- the
# selectivity contrast with imp-strike2500's open-often window.
# Everything else is flame-nocover.

name imp-strike4000
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 1
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
hold 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 1
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 4000
